---
import ZineLayout from '../../../layouts/ZineLayout.astro';
import { featureGuide, topicLabel } from '../../../zine/content';

const guide = featureGuide;
const page = String(guide.page).padStart(2, '0');
---
<ZineLayout title={`${guide.title} | UHAK GPS`} description={guide.dek}>
  <article>
    <header class="bg-surface editorial-rule-bottom">
      <div class="wrap flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-ink py-3">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="ed-meta flex items-center gap-2">
          <a href="/zine/" class="border-b border-transparent hover:border-ink">Home</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="text-muted">{topicLabel(guide.topic)}</span>
        </nav>
        <span class="ed-meta">p.{page}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap grid gap-8 py-10 landing:py-14 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_300px] lg:items-end lg:gap-16">
        <div>
          <p class="ed-eyebrow m-0">{topicLabel(guide.topic)}</p>
          <h1 class="m-0 mt-4 max-w-[18ch] text-[clamp(34px,5vw,64px)] font-semibold leading-[1] tracking-[-0.03em]">{guide.title}</h1>
        </div>
        <p class="m-0 font-brand text-[clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)] italic leading-[1.4]">{guide.dek}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <dl class="ed-meta m-0 grid grid-cols-1 border-t border-ink landing:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="flex gap-2 py-3 pr-4"><dt class="text-muted">Words</dt><dd class="m-0">UHAK GPS desk</dd></div>
          <div class="flex gap-2 border-t border-ink py-3 pr-4 landing:border-l landing:border-t-0 landing:border-ink landing:pl-4"><dt class="text-muted">Filed</dt><dd class="m-0">{guide.date}</dd></div>
          <div class="flex gap-2 border-t border-ink py-3 landing:border-l landing:border-t-0 landing:pl-4"><dt class="text-muted">Place</dt><dd class="m-0">Sydney</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-paper">
      <div class="wrap pt-8 landing:pt-10">
        <div class="aspect-[4/3] border border-ink bg-surface landing:aspect-[16/7]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="wrap grid gap-10 py-12 landing:py-16 lg:grid-cols-[200px_minmax(0,1fr)_220px] lg:gap-12">
        <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start" aria-label="In this guide">
          <p class="ed-meta m-0 border-b border-ink pb-2 font-bold">In this guide</p>
          <ol class="m-0 list-none p-0">
            <li class="border-b border-ink">
              <a href="#ask" class="flex gap-3 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold leading-snug hover:underline">
                <span class="ed-meta pt-0.5 text-muted">1</span>
                Questions to ask before you pay
              </a>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </aside>

        <div class="prose-ed max-w-[64ch]">
          <p class="dropcap text-[17px]">
            Before you pay fees, check class size, nationality mix, and the weekly timetable. Those details shape day-to-day study.
          </p>
          <h2 id="ask" class="mb-0 mt-12! border-t border-ink pt-5 text-[22px] font-semibold uppercase leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.01em]">
            Questions to ask before you pay
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-none border-t border-ink p-0">
            <li class="flex gap-4 border-b border-ink py-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.55]">
              <span class="mt-[7px] inline-block size-2.5 shrink-0 bg-accent ring-1 ring-ink" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              How many students are in a class, on average, this month?
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4 border-b border-ink py-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.55]">
              <span class="mt-[7px] inline-block size-2.5 shrink-0 bg-accent ring-1 ring-ink" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              What is the nationality mix in the level I would join?
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4 border-b border-ink py-3 text-[15px] leading-[1.55]">
              <span class="mt-[7px] inline-block size-2.5 shrink-0 bg-accent ring-1 ring-ink" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              Can I try a class before I commit to more weeks?
            </li>
          </ul>
          <aside class="mt-10 border border-ink bg-mint p-7">
            <p class="m-0 text-[15px] font-semibold uppercase">Our approach</p>
            <p class="m-0 mt-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.6]">We suggest schools that match what you told us. If a better option is outside our partners, we say so.</p>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <aside class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start" aria-label="Ask about this guide">
          <div class="border border-ink bg-mint p-6">
            <p class="ed-meta m-0 font-bold">Ask about this</p>
            <p class="m-0 mt-3 text-[16px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]">Bring your questions to a free chat.</p>
            <a href="/zine/book/" class="ed-btn mt-5 w-full">Book a chat</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="ed-meta m-0 border-b border-ink pb-2 font-bold">Filed under</p>
            <span class="editorial-pill mt-3 inline-flex">{topicLabel(guide.topic)}</span>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</ZineLayout>
